    <html:li><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0038/" title="The degree law" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0038/" display-uri="ffi-0038" type="local">The degree law</fr:link> — the degree.</html:li>
    <html:li><fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0039/" title="The leading-term law" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0039/" display-uri="ffi-0039" type="local">The leading-term law</fr:link> — the leading coefficient.</html:li>
